<title>UK: Pakistan buys 4,000 tonnes palm olein - trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan buys 4,000 tonnes palm olein - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's State-run Trading Corporation of Pakistan (TCP) bought 4,000 tonnes of palm olein for shipment by December 20 at its tender on Tuesday, European vegetable oil traders said.</p>
<p>The TCP bought from the lowest bidder Qulei Edible Oil of Malaysia at $577.93 a tonne c and f.</p>
<p>The TCP recieved a total five bids. --Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
